    {
      "id": "lesson-course-lld-intro",
      "courseId": "course-lld",
      "moduleId": "group-changing-policies",
      "slug": "lesson-course-lld-intro",
      "title": "Changing Policies",
      "type": "LESSON",
      "visibility": "PUBLIC",
      "paymentAccess": "FREE",
      "publicationStatus": "PUBLISHED",
      "required": true,
      "order": 3,
      "body": "# Changing Policies\n\nIn real-world business domains, pricing, discounting, and promotional rules change frequently. Hardcoding these rules into core transactional workflows causes coupling and regression risks.\n\nBy applying the Strategy Pattern to policies:\n- Each calculation rule is encapsulated behind a shared policy interface.\n- New discounting mechanisms can be introduced without touching existing ordering or billing code.\n- Different policies can be composed or selected dynamically based on user tier, seasonal campaigns, or cart attributes.\n"
    },
